    `Clear()` resets a `rapidcsv::Document` to an empty state: it removes all loaded data, column names, and row names, and resets encoding flags (`mIsUtf16`, `mIsLE`, `mHasUtf8BOM`) to false. Use it when you want to reuse the same `Document` object for new data. Its signature is:
