     * @brief   Clears loaded Document data.
     *
     */
void Clear();
    ```
10. `rapidcsv::no_converter::what`
    `rapidcsv::no_converter::what()` is the exception message accessor for failed/unsupported type conversion. Use it via `catch(const std::exception&)` or `catch(const rapidcsv::no_converter&)` to get `"unsupported conversion datatype"`. It always returns that fixed string. Its signature is:
    ```cpp
