15. `rapidcsv::Document::GetRowName`
    Returns the row label for a zero-based data row index. Use it only when `mLabelParams.mRowNameIdx >= 0`; otherwise it throws `std::out_of_range`. It maps the row index via `GetDataRowIndex()` and then returns that cell from `mData`. Its signature is:
